  "findings": [
    "KAL education and surrounding verified residential areas gain restrained metric tonal variation instead of a completely flat fill. Real access paths remain uncut.",
    "LEN now publishes the complete source-ground generation without the earlier diagonal cap cut; the largest observed estimated peak is below the fixed 8 MiB limit.",
    "SOV and MET unknown strips remain visibly unchanged, preserving the distinction between available landuse polygons and missing source classification.",
    "The user camera retains native black courtyard paths absent from the movement-road subset. The three control scenes preserve shorelines, building footprints, courtyard paving and road surfaces.",
    "MET roofs no longer show the prior repeated diagonal metallic stamp. Organic trees are visible, and source woodland remains outside the neutral material.",
    "Long KAL/LEN facades still repeat similar blue windows and pale shell treatments. Stable family palette variation can improve reading but cannot replace architectural window rhythm or depth."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Overall SimCity 2013 artistic acceptance remains open; this scoped ground improvement is not a whole-city art pass.",
    "TiledGameLayer.ts, opposingLaneReservations.ts and the newly added gameFacadeAppearance.ts changed during the capture suite. Ground helper, material and Scene integration were unchanged. The captures therefore are not a single frozen full-runtime baseline and should not be used to accept the later facade or traffic changes.",
    "KAL before/after captured a late motion-data refresh; the ground comparison remains visible but this pair is not motion evidence.",
    "The mobile courtyard crop exposes almost no new landuse surface: the before/after PNGs are identical there, consistent with courtyard exclusion.",
    "Motion correctness, real-device mobile performance and 30 FPS acceptance require separate evidence.",
    "Low-detail or unusually complex source input can exceed a cap and retain a previous viable generation or the base map; diagnostics report the explicit retained/error state.",
    "Earlier intermediate captures that showed missing native footpaths or partial polygon caps are superseded by this run and are not acceptance evidence.",
    "PNGs remain local; this document stores portable filenames and content hashes only."
  ]
